## Summary
The article outlines plans to create an international business city next to Gadeokdo New Airport, with initiatives to incorporate it into a free economic zone. This development aims to enhance regional economic growth and business opportunities.

## Key Points
- An international business city is proposed for construction adjacent to Gadeokdo New Airport.
- Efforts are underway to include the area in a free economic zone.
- The project is intended to boost economic development and attract business activities.


